    },
    "One of the best years of your life": {
      "comment": "InboundGuide welcome: a point.",
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "One of your host families might suggest a holiday somewhere abroad. This is usually fine when you have written approval from your parents.": {
      "comment": "InboundGuide travel: a point explained.",
