    },
    "Our motto": {
      "comment": "InboundGuide welcome: a section heading.",
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "Overweeg landen waar je de taal spreekt of wilt leren.": {
      "comment": "OutboundGuide countryPreference: a step or tip explained.",
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "Persoonlijke ontwikkeling": {
      "comment": "OutboundGuide campsWho: a point.",
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "Please remember that under all circumstances you are an ambassador of Rotary and will have to behave accordingly. You will also be an ambassador of your country. Both roles will be with you at all times, and you will be regarded and judged as such throughout your exchange.": {
      "comment": "InboundGuide welcome: a point explained.",
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "Policy documents": {
      "comment": "InboundGuide insurance: a section heading.",
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "Praat met voormalige uitwisselingsstudenten over hun ervaringen in verschillende landen.": {
      "comment": "OutboundGuide topThree: a step or tip explained.",
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "Prachtige natuur en een vriendelijke cultuur in Noord-Amerika.": {
      "comment": "OutboundGuide campsCountries: a point explained.",
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "Regels en richtlijnen voor uitwisselingsstudenten": {
