    },
    "The challenge": {
      "comment": "InboundGuide language: a section heading.",
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "The insurance policy from the Netherlands is compulsory. We will pre-insure you, so you are fully insured from the moment you land at Amsterdam Airport Schiphol until you leave from the airport again.": {
      "comment": "InboundGuide insurance: a paragraph.",
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "There is no hiding it: Dutch is a very difficult language to learn. However, we do expect you to master the language, and within months after your arrival to be fluent in it.": {
      "comment": "InboundGuide language: a paragraph.",
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "Tips for exploring the Netherlands and Europe": {
      "comment": "InboundGuide: what a page tells, under its title in the list.",
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "Tips voor een goede keuze": {
      "comment": "OutboundGuide countryPreference: a section heading.\nOutboundGuide topThree: a section heading.",
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
