    },
    "You should obtain a changeable open return airline ticket. Your arrival airport is Amsterdam Airport Schiphol.": {
      "comment": "InboundGuide flightAndArrival: a paragraph.",
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "You will make friends from all over the world, in addition to making many Dutch friends in your school and Rotary.": {
